pyEnvipat
=========

This package is a Python port of the R package `enviPat`, originally
developed at Eawag (Swiss Federal Institute of Aquatic Science and
Technology) by Martin Loos and Christian Gerber:

  Loos, M., Gerber, C., Corona, F., Hollender, J., Singer, H. (2015)
  "Accelerated Isotope Fine Structure Calculation Using Pruned
  Transition Trees", Analytical Chemistry.
  doi:10.1021/acs.analchem.5b00941

